  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

  /odm/overlay/config/config.xml — which overlays of this partition Android
  enables, and immutably.  Needed for OniroInstallerOpaque, whose target is
  not the framework: android:isStatic only reaches overlays of "android".

  OniroNoBars is listed too although it is static.  A partition that HAS a
  config file is governed by it alone: the first version of this file named
  only the installer overlay, and Android's own status and navigation bars
  came back the next boot.
-->
<config>
    <overlay package="org.oniroproject.waydroid.overlay.nobars" enabled="true" mutable="false" />
    <overlay package="org.oniroproject.waydroid.overlay.installer" enabled="true" mutable="false" />
</config>
